Z||000000||Loki||12-14-2001||06:54 PM||||OK im working on a s/c 3800 to go into my 86SE..Will be worked over (i.e. heads intake and such) I also would like to use about a 75 shot of NOS. What should I pay attention to to make this more reliable? Better engine managment (spark, timing and air/fuel)?  Forged bottom parts? What exactly?<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroloki.com/lokisig1%20copy.jpg">   <BR>"All Fieros broke right now" :(||||reg||1
